{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>בעידנא</b> — at the time." "<b>קל קרנא</b> — the sound of the shofar." "<b>משרוקיתא</b> — an instrument to whistle with. Only קתרוס and its companions are all musical instruments, and also in the sacred language: כינור and מחול and מינים and עוגב — but we do not know their names, even though עוגב is from the root of ותעגבה, and מינים are two instruments, and מחול is a flute, and כינור is like the shape of a menorah — and these are reasonings without proof."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:32.267499707Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}